{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块直接呈现人物处境、原因和心理转折，单看大字也更容易串起故事；Y 的重点短语有些需要依靠未放大的文字才能恢复关系。small：Y 的小字更常补充具体情境和心理转折，如 S07 的“甜梦一下碎了”、S09 的“那扇门又出现了”，X 则有一些小字重复大字已经表达的意思。core：Y 更清楚地呈现怀念归属与拒绝再次忍受委屈之间的拉扯，尤其 S11—S13 把不凭盼头回去忍让、带着想念继续生活的选择交代得更完整。concise：Y 的主线更收束，X 多处在大小字之间或相邻屏幕重复舍不得、回不去、没有答案等意思；human：Y 整体表达更接近日常说话，X 的“高兴很快变酸”“不服气散尽后只剩离开他们的难受”“不肯凭盼头回去忍让”等搭配和压缩比较生硬，Y 也有“活动感”等个别不自然表达，但整体稍好。fine：X 的感受更常落在观众能体会的身体反应和心理经验上，Y 则有较多直接描述和弦、节奏、旋律的内容；load：Y 的放大短语较短，意群切分也比较自然，尤其 S08、S11、S12 等短停留屏幕，明显比 X 的整块长句更容易扫读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "010e8f2d-edb7-45e0-a447-c4cc3bbde672", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T200959904115Z", "elapsed_seconds": 268.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:14:28.886519+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d726cd430c7c7e4893b5982316e698602f74d69377b05df11baeac8776ce12d2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "att